{
  "sutta_id": "AN4.32",
  "verses": [
    {
      "number": 1,
      "pali": "Numerical Discourses 4.32",
      "english": "Numerical Discourses 4.32"
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "pali": "Saṅgaha Sutta",
      "english": "The Bonds of Fellowship"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "“There are these four grounds for the bonds of fellowship. Which four? Giving, kind words, beneficial help, consistency. These are the four grounds for the bonds of fellowship.”"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Giving, kind words, beneficial help,"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "& consistency in the face of events,"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "in line with what’s appropriate"
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "in each case, each case."
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "These bonds of fellowship (function) in the world"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "like the linchpins in a moving cart."
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Now, if these bonds of fellowship were lacking,"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "a mother would not receive"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "the honor & respect owed by her child,"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "nor would a father receive"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "what his child owes him."
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "But because the wise show regard"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "for these bonds of fellowship,"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "they achieve greatness"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "and are praised."
    }
  ]
}